{
    "id": "b8daedf9-279e-40dc-a253-93119da454f4",
    "scriptName": "状态栏·多维矩阵",
    "findRegex": "/.+/s",
    "replaceString": "```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.5.1/css/all.min.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/anaka123987-cmd/statusbar@49dfd7e144ac48a59b103bbeb0cbebf27ad1759d/dist/statusbar.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    \n<section id=\"mx-title-overlay\" class=\"mx-overlay\">\n\n<section class='mx-o-view is-active' data-o-view='title'><div class='mx-title-layout'><div><div class='mx-kicker'><i></i><span>AUTHOR / 卡卡bot</span></div><h1 class='mx-game-title'>多维矩阵</h1><p class='mx-author'>CREATED BY <b>卡卡bot</b></p><p class='mx-title-copy'>欢迎接入多维矩阵。系统将读取当前酒馆楼层状态；新档案进入角色创建，已有进度交由主控制台继续接管。</p><button class='mx-btn' id='startBtn' type='button'>开始游戏</button><div class='mx-note' id='titleNote'></div></div><aside class='mx-signal-card'><div class='mx-node-ring'></div><div class='mx-signal-list'><div class='mx-signal-item'><span>维度信标</span><span>ONLINE</span></div><div class='mx-signal-item'><span>叙事终端</span><span>STANDBY</span></div><div class='mx-signal-item'><span>档案锚点</span><span>WAITING</span></div></div></aside></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"mx-o-view\" data-o-view=\"resume\"><div class=\"mx-panel\" style=\"width:620px;margin:72px auto 0;padding:38px;border-radius:26px;border:1px solid rgba(42,38,64,.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,.76);box-shadow:0 18px 54px rgba(42,38,64,.1);text-align:center\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:.08em\">检测到已有进度</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;color:#6b6578;line-height:1.9\">最新楼层不为0，开场页已完成入口判断。请继续使用多维矩阵主状态栏页面进行游戏。</p><button class=\"mx-btn mx-ghost\" id=\"resumeBack\" type=\"button\">返回标题</button></div></section>\n\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"mx-create-overlay\" class=\"mx-overlay\">\n<div class='mx-shell'><aside class='mx-card mx-side'><div class='mx-logo'><b>多维矩阵</b><span>档案初始化</span></div><nav><button class='mx-step is-active' data-step='stage'>阶段</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='identity'>身份</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='entry'>接入</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='build'>强化</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='dungeon'>副本</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='attrs'>属性</button><button class='mx-step' data-step='confirm'>确认</button></nav><div class='mx-actions'><button class='mx-soft-btn' id='prevStep' type='button'>上一步</button><button class='mx-soft-btn' id='randomAll' type='button'>随机生成</button><button class='mx-soft-btn mx-primary' id='nextStep' type='button'>下一步</button></div></aside><section class='mx-card mx-main'><div class='mx-view is-active' data-view='stage'><h1>轮回者阶段</h1><p class='mx-sub'>阶段决定阶位、属性点、技能数量、积分与KPI压力。每个阶段的总属性差约36到50点，强度变化会更明显。</p><div class='mx-grid' id='stageGrid'></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='identity'><h1>现实身份</h1><p class='mx-sub'>身份提供推荐方向，但不会锁死数值。选择自定义后可以填写完整身份描述。</p><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>姓名</label><input id='nameInput' placeholder='例如：林见川'></div><div class='mx-field'><label>代号</label><input id='codeInput' placeholder='例如：零号'></div></div><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>性别</label><select id='genderInput'><option>男</option><option>女</option><option>非公开</option><option>自定义</option></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>年龄</label><input id='ageInput' type='number' min='12' max='120' value='24'></div></div><div class='mx-field'><label>现实世界所在地</label><input id='locInput' placeholder='例如：东京'></div><div class='mx-field'><label>身份模板</label><select id='identitySelect'></select></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='identityCustomBox'><label>自定义身份</label><textarea id='customIdentity' placeholder='例如：前急诊医生，因一次异常事故接触矩阵。'></textarea></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='entry'><h1>接入记录</h1><p class='mx-sub'>接入方式会影响开场白。故事时代与地区在这里填写，用于创建第1层消息的初始世界。</p><div class='mx-grid' id='entryGrid'></div><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>故事时代</label><select id='eraInput'><option>现代都市</option><option>近未来</option><option>废土时代</option><option>低魔中古</option><option>高魔纪元</option><option>星际时代</option><option>自定义</option></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>故事地区</label><input id='regionInput' placeholder='例如：东京湾第七码头'></div></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='eraCustomBox'><label>自定义时代</label><input id='customEra' placeholder='填写自定义时代背景'></div><div class='mx-field'><label>最后记忆</label><textarea id='lastMemory' placeholder='进入矩阵前最后记得的画面。'></textarea></div><div class='mx-field'><label>最大执念</label><input id='obsession' placeholder='例如：活下去，回家，复仇，证明自己'></div><div class='mx-field'><label>致命缺陷</label><input id='flaw' placeholder='例如：过度自信，容易共情，恐惧密闭空间'></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='build'><h1>强化倾向</h1><p class='mx-sub'>新人只记录适配倾向，第一次副本内觉醒；有经历的轮回者会拥有低阶成型强化。强化方向可以自定义。</p><div class='mx-grid' id='enhanceGrid'></div><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>强化方向</label><select id='directionSelect'></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>能量类型</label><select id='energySelect'><option>科技能量</option><option>魔力</option><option>精神力</option><option>怒气</option><option>自定义</option></select></div></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='directionCustomBox'><label>自定义强化方向</label><input id='customDirection' placeholder='例如：梦境植入与记忆剪辑'></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='energyCustomBox'><label>自定义能量类型</label><input id='customEnergy' placeholder='例如：熵能、灵压、源质'></div><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>初始辅助技能</label><select id='skillSelect'></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>价值倾向</label><select id='alignmentSelect'></select></div></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='skillCustomBox'><label>自定义初始技能</label><input id='customSkill' placeholder='例如：短距预判'></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='dungeon'><h1>副本偏好</h1><p class='mx-sub'>副本由矩阵随机分配。这里仅记录叙事偏好，不保证实际进入该类型。</p><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>副本偏好</label><select id='dungeonSelect'></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>战斗强度</label><select id='combatSelect'><option>低</option><option selected>中</option><option>高</option></select></div></div><div class='mx-field mx-custom' id='dungeonCustomBox'><label>自定义副本偏好</label><input id='customDungeon' placeholder='例如：海上列车异常事故'></div><div class='mx-mini-row'><div class='mx-field'><label>探索比例</label><select id='exploreSelect'><option>低</option><option selected>中</option><option>高</option></select></div><div class='mx-field'><label>社交复杂度</label><select id='socialSelect'><option>低</option><option selected>中</option><option>高</option></select></div></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='attrs'><h1>属性校准</h1><p class='mx-sub'>只分配六维基础属性。生命值、能量、防御等衍生属性由系统后续计算。</p><div class='mx-attr-head'><span>总点数随阶段浮动</span><span class='mx-points' id='pointInfo'></span></div><div id='attrList'></div></div><div class='mx-view' data-view='confirm'><h1>档案确认</h1><p class='mx-sub'>点击后会尝试读取0层 InitVar 的 stat_data，覆盖玩家选择，并创建第1层开场消息。</p><button class='mx-soft-btn mx-primary' id='makeProfile' type='button'>生成档案摘要</button><button class='mx-soft-btn' id='sendInput' type='button'>仅填入输入框</button><textarea class='mx-output' id='profileOutput' readonly placeholder='点击生成档案摘要'></textarea></div></section><aside class='mx-card mx-preview'><h2 class='mx-preview-title'>实时档案</h2><div class='mx-preview-body' id='preview'></div><div class='mx-status' id='note'>等待创建。状态提示会显示在这里，避免污染底部布局。</div></aside></div>\n\n</section>\n<div id=\"mx-console\">\n        <div class=\"mx-topbar\">\n            <div class=\"mx-title\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>多维矩阵 · 终端</div>\n            <div class=\"mx-topbar-btns\">\n                <button class=\"mx-icon-btn\" id=\"mx-fullscreen-toggle\" title=\"全屏\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-expand\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-tabs\" id=\"mx-tabs\">\n            <div class=\"mx-tab active\" data-mxtab=\"narrative\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-book-open\"></i> 剧情</div>\n            <div class=\"mx-tab\" data-mxtab=\"status\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-line\"></i> 状态</div>\n            <div class=\"mx-tab combat\" data-mxtab=\"combat\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-khanda\"></i> 战斗</div>\n            <div class=\"mx-tab\" data-mxtab=\"teammates\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-users\"></i> 队友</div>\n            <div class=\"mx-tab\" data-mxtab=\"exchange\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-scale-balanced\"></i> 交易所</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-page active\" id=\"mx-page-narrative\">\n            <div class=\"mx-section\" id=\"mx-section-content\">\n                <div class=\"mx-section-head\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-book-open ico\"></i><span>正文</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mx-section-body\">\n                    <div class=\"mx-content-box\" id=\"mx-content-box\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mx-section collapsed\" id=\"mx-section-options\">\n                <div class=\"mx-section-head\" id=\"mx-options-head\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-list-check ico\"></i><span>选项</span>\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow\"></i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mx-section-body\">\n                    <div class=\"mx-options-body collapsed\" id=\"mx-options-body\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mx-pseudo-input\" id=\"mx-pseudo-input\">\n                <div class=\"mx-pseudo-row\">\n                    <textarea class=\"mx-pseudo-text\" id=\"mx-pseudo-text\" rows=\"1\" placeholder=\"输入你的行动或对话...\"></textarea>\n                    <button class=\"mx-pseudo-send\" id=\"mx-pseudo-send\" type=\"button\" title=\"发送\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-paper-plane\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mx-pseudo-state\" id=\"mx-pseudo-state\">等待输入</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-page\" id=\"mx-page-status\">\n            <div class=\"mx-section-body\">\n                <div id=\"nebula-hud\">\n                    <div class=\"neb-topbar\">\n                        <div class=\"neb-title\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>状态终端</div>\n                        <button class=\"neb-collapse-btn\" id=\"neb-collapse\">▲</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"neb-tabs\" id=\"neb-tabs\">\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab active\" data-page=\"home\">主页</div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab\" data-page=\"profile\">个人档案</div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab\" data-page=\"quest\">任务</div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab\" data-page=\"world\">任务世界</div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab\" data-page=\"log\">日志情报</div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-tab\" data-page=\"faction\">阵营关系</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"neb-body\">\n                        <div class=\"neb-page active\" id=\"page-home\"><div class=\"neb-empty\">正在连接矩阵数据...</div></div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-page\" id=\"page-profile\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-page\" id=\"page-quest\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-page\" id=\"page-world\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-page\" id=\"page-log\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"neb-page\" id=\"page-faction\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-page\" id=\"mx-page-combat\">\n            <div class=\"mx-combat-mount\" id=\"mx-combat-mount\">\n                <div class=\"mx-combat-loading\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-gear fa-spin\"></i> 战斗控制台加载中...</div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"mx-cb-stage\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-page\" id=\"mx-page-teammates\">\n            <div class=\"tm-wrap\">\n                <div class=\"tm-topbar\">\n                    <div class=\"tm-title\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>队友终端</div>\n                    <div class=\"tm-stats\" id=\"tm-stats\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tm-sync\" id=\"tm-sync\"><span class=\"neb-led led-yellow tm-led\"></span><span>正在监听楼层中的队友信息...</span></div>\n                <div class=\"tm-detail\" id=\"tm-detail\"></div>\n                <div class=\"tm-body\" id=\"tm-body\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mx-page\" id=\"mx-page-exchange\">\n            <div class=\"mx-section-body\">\n                <div id=\"mx-ex-hud\">\n                    <div class=\"neb-body\" id=\"mx-ex-body\"><div class=\"neb-empty\">正在连接矩阵数据...</div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/anaka123987-cmd/statusbar@49dfd7e144ac48a59b103bbeb0cbebf27ad1759d/dist/statusbar.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/anaka123987-cmd/statusbar@49dfd7e144ac48a59b103bbeb0cbebf27ad1759d/dist/teammates.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/anaka123987-cmd/statusbar@49dfd7e144ac48a59b103bbeb0cbebf27ad1759d/dist/check.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
